        "evidence": "The chart title and subtitle explicitly state that only 'Selected Sentinel Sites' are shown, and specifically 'Reported sites with the highest case loads'. This matches the condition that the displayed subset is limited and not representative of the network. The B reading does not require a policy basis for follow-up review; it only requires that the subset limitation disqualifies escalation. This condition is met by the visual evidence. The reading is therefore supported.",
